I usually only reply to messages asking for Mac NetHack, and it looks like
it is time again for a general posting.

You can use anonymous FTP to retrieve version 2.3e of nethack from
handies.ucar.edu (128.117.64.4).  You can either get the entire file
'pub/Mac/nethack2.3e.sit.hqx', or the split files
'pub/Mac/nethack2.3e.sit.hqx.[1-6]' if your FTP link isn't too good.

Or you can send me a floppy and a self-addressed-stamped floppy mailer
and I'll put it on the floppy for you.  Use the address at the bottom
of the letter.
